OL,3,GNEWSAThe Deadlifting Grandma: 'I'm a
OL,4,Aworld champion'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 65-year-old grandmother has become a
OL,7,Fthree-time world champion powerlifter
OL,8,Fafter only starting the sport two and a
OL,9,Fhalf years ago.
OL,11,FMartine Barons, from
OL,12,FStratford-upon-Avon, said she began
OL,13,Flifting weights during lockdown after
OL,14,Flistening to a seminar that said women
OL,15,Fgoing through menopause should run less
OL,16,Fand lift more.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
