OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAThe Deadlifting Grandma: 'I'm a
OL,4,Aworld champion'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer colleague at the University of
OL,7,FWarwick, who is also a personal
OL,8,Ftrainer, then showed Barons how to
OL,9,Fdeadlift, and spotted her potential.
OL,10,FBarons is now nicknamed The Deadlifting
OL,11,FGrandma.
OL,13,FOn Monday, she won at the AWPC World
OL,14,FPowerlifting Championships in the 65 to
OL,15,F85 age group, becoming a three-time
OL,16,Fworld champion, after starting out
OL,17,Fentering competitions just for fun.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
